# CineTrace AI

Product is **CineTrace AI**: a VFX studio supervisor that kills render-farm compute waste by analyzing telemetry.

Only these agents exist. Do not invent extra agent roles:

- **Diagnostic Sentinel** — detect waste / anomalies in farm telemetry
- **Studio Orchestrator** — decide what to do next
- **Action Agent** — execute the remediation

ClickHouse is the telemetry store. Agents talk to it through **MCP**. Use real queries, not mocked “as if” ClickHouse.

Stack constraint: **Gemini + Google Cloud Agent Builder / ADK / Agent Engine**. Do not substitute another orchestrator as the submission core.

Devpost ClickHouse track: Google Cloud and ClickHouse must be **imported and called in code**, not only named in the README.

No secrets in git. Use env files (gitignored) or Secret Manager.

This repo stays **private** until pre-submit. Do not add or commit an OSS license unless asked.

Do not pull Milepo, Paperclip, or Oracle conventions into this repo.
